    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.poster.avif?t=1528474420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.webm?t=1528474420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.mp4?t=1528474420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this experience you have the opportunity to admire unique antiquities from ancient Greece, Rome, Egypt, India and Asia.<br>You can see about 60 authentic works of art gathered in one place from museums from all over the world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/42d0adb9fc6cbcc3036f0e808a985a01.avif?t=1528474420\" /></div><br><br>State-of-the-art technologies have been used to transfer them to VR. All the models are photo realistic and of the top quality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/fcb026f375adf1580cd4bb7528b53ca1.avif?t=1528474420\" /></div><br><br>It is the first museum in the world from where you can set out for a trip to ancient times.<br>It's the only occasion to admire ancient buildings, search through Egyptian temples, <br>see under your eyes the beauty of Japan and feel the atmosphere of ancient temple in India.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.poster.avif?t=1528474420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.webm?t=1528474420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/b70fc2e9ac935c20edaf6f51e6a59d6c.mp4?t=1528474420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this experience you have the opportunity to admire unique antiquities from ancient Greece, Rome, Egypt, India and Asia.<br>You can see about 60 authentic works of art gathered in one place from museums from all over the world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/42d0adb9fc6cbcc3036f0e808a985a01.avif?t=1528474420\" /></div><br><br>State-of-the-art technologies have been used to transfer them to VR. All the models are photo realistic and of the top quality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854030/extras/fcb026f375adf1580cd4bb7528b53ca1.avif?t=1528474420\" /></div><br><br>It is the first museum in the world from where you can set out for a trip to ancient times.<br>It's the only occasion to admire ancient buildings, search through Egyptian temples, <br>see under your eyes the beauty of Japan and feel the atmosphere of ancient temple in India.",
